# AIcrow Core Stack

- Use Node.js `20.18.x` and Yarn `1.22.x`.
- Keep changes minimal and scoped to the task.
- Reuse existing utilities and components before creating new abstractions.
- Do not introduce new dependencies unless there is no practical alternative.
- Keep TypeScript strict; avoid `any` and unsafe casts.
- User-facing assistant responses should be in Ukrainian.

# Quality Gates

- Validate with `yarn lint:check` for static checks.
- Validate with `yarn test` for unit behavior.
- Prefer `yarn verify:ci` for pre-merge confidence.

# Architecture Baseline

- Next.js App Router structure is source of truth.
- i18n is based on `i18n/routing.ts` and `app/[locale]/...`.
- Auth/session flows must align with `lib/auth.ts`, `lib/auth-cookies.ts`, and `middleware.ts`.
